an class=\"av av-agent\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <path d=\"M12 2.6 13.6 9 20 10.6 13.6 12.2 12 18.6 10.4 12.2 4 10.6 10.4 9Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/>\n              <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"18.4\" r=\"2.6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/>\n            </svg>\n          </span>\n          <div class=\"reply-body\">\n\n            <div class=\"tool\">\n              <div class=\"tool-head\">\n                <span class=\"lead\">\n                  <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"8.2\"/><path d=\"M12 7.4v4.6l3 1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg>\n                  <span class=\"tool-label\">Planning…</span>\n                </span>\n                <span class=\"tool-tail\">\n                  <span class=\"chev\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m7 10 5 5 5-5\"/></svg></span>\n                </span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <p class=\"say\">I'll audit the checkout flow for authentication gaps. First, let me sync the latest commits from the repository and map every module that reads or writes session state.</p>\n\n            <div class=\"tool\">\n              <div class=\"tool-cmd\">\n                <span class=\"cmd-path\">~/…/checkout-api</span>\n                <span class=\"cmd-run\"><span class=\"pct\">%</span> <span class=\"lit\">git fetch --prune</span></span>\n                <span class=\"tool-tail\">\n                  <span class=\"chev\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"10.5\" height=\"10.5\" rx=\"2\"/><